            "description_html": "<b>36\" Inch Carpet Separator</b>\r\n<p>\r\nPemko 36\" Inch Carpet Separator. These 36\" Inch Long Carpet Separator are made from non rusting extruded aluminum.  \r\n</p>\r\n<b>About Carpet Separators</b>\r\n<p>\r\nCarpet Separator thresholds are used to provide an air space between two pieces of carpet that otherwise would join together. This is frequently required when carpet is installed under a fire door. Carpet Separator thresholds are also used to provide a solid surface for a door sweep or automatic door bottom to close against.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for PEM-1951A/36 Carpet Separator\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Mill Finish Aluminum</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
